  "question": {
    "text": "Consider the oxy acids  <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow></msub></math>  series, here value of n is 1 to 4. Then incorrect statement regarding these oxy acids is"
  },
