      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "Thermal stability of oxy acids decreases with increasing value of n",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></math>  bond order decreases with decreasing value of n",
